<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Lufthansa.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Lufthansa.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Wertpapiere GmbH has issued one million American-style call warrants on shares of Deutsche Lufthansa AG, lead manager Morgan Stanley Bank AG said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    30 DEM		    PREMIUM	15.5 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     3.61 DEM		  GEARING	8.0 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITYE DATE  19.JUN.98		 PAYDATE	04.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT			 MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  29.10 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
